# Security

<!-- {{ns}}:start house-style -->

## Reporting a vulnerability

Report it privately to {{authorName}} through a GitHub security advisory on {{org}}/{{repo}}{{securityAlt}}. Don't open a public issue or pull request for it. Include what you found, how to reproduce it and the plugin version.

<!-- {{ns}}:end house-style -->

## What the plugin runs

- **MCP server:** `node` runs `server/index.mjs` on your machine. It has no dependencies outside the bundle and makes no network calls unless a tool says it does.
- **Usage log hook:** unless `{{NS}}_SKILL_LOG=0`, `DO_NOT_TRACK=1` or CI is set, a hook writes one line per skill run to `~/.{{ns}}/skill-log.jsonl`. It sends nothing anywhere.
